{"title":"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Direct)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Direct)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Stepwise)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Stepwise)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Combination_of_Solutions_1_and_2)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Combination of Solutions 1 and 2)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(🚀Under_1_min🚀)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (🚀Under 1 min🚀)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_The_Learning_Royal\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by The Learning Royal</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_North_America_Math_Contest_Go_Go_Go\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_STEMbreezy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by STEMbreezy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Luka is making lemonade to sell at a school fundraiser. His recipe requires <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times as much water as sugar and twice as much sugar as lemon juice. He uses <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cups of lemon juice. How many cups of water does he need?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/0/d50650c6096434ab4938e1bc546e13d3e162ebbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }6 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }8 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }12 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }18 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"380\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Direct.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Direct)\">Solution 1 (Direct)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Direct)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/3/6e3db0e8775b1a777619c74e74f7e134ac07444c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{water} : \\text{sugar} : \\text{lemon juice} = 4\\cdot 2 : 2 : 1 = 8 : 2 : 1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"381\" height=\"16\" /> so Luka needs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/3/bc318570ee859f6da3ee43fe3e1b8d1e5ad4b54d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\cdot 8 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\" /> cups.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Stepwise.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Stepwise)\">Solution 2 (Stepwise)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Stepwise)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the amount of sugar is twice the amount of lemon juice, Luka uses <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5ab8719adf30b98aa8ed28d1b5da5fec0259c2bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot2=6$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> cups of sugar.\n</p><p>Since the amount of water is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times the amount of sugar, he uses <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/3/0e3cbef858e7b8a4aa1324007e4fb7a1e72dcda2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\cdot4=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\" /> cups of water.\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Combination_of_Solutions_1_and_2.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Combination_of_Solutions_1_and_2)\">Solution 3 (Combination of Solutions 1 and 2)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Combination of Solutions 1 and 2)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The ratio is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/8/b389e90f755ff8e87876fd5103abc3e926fa4196.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Water}:\\text{Sugar}:\\text{Lemon Juice},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"212\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce677c53b3c3883416e7da3f93ee51cf15ad3cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8:2:1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" /> Since we know that Luka used 3 cups of lemon juice, he needs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5ab8719adf30b98aa8ed28d1b5da5fec0259c2bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot2=6$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> cups of sugar. Because the amount of water is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times the amount of sugar Luka needs, he will need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/3/0e3cbef858e7b8a4aa1324007e4fb7a1e72dcda2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\cdot4=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\" /> cups of water.\n</p><p>Thanks to MRENTHUSIASM for the inspiration!\n</p><p>EarthSaver 15:12, 11 June 2021 (EDT)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_.28Easy_to_understand.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8hgK6rESdek&amp;t=9s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8hgK6rESdek&amp;t=9s</a>\n</p><p>~NiuniuMaths\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/UnVo6jZ3Wnk?si=KUWl6TL6PU9LtC7o&amp;t=105\">https://youtu.be/UnVo6jZ3Wnk?si=KUWl6TL6PU9LtC7o&amp;t=105</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.F0.9F.9A.80Under_1_min.F0.9F.9A.80.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(🚀Under_1_min🚀)\">Video Solution (🚀Under 1 min🚀)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (🚀Under 1 min🚀)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/T1K8irAOxRk\">https://youtu.be/T1K8irAOxRk</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/FPC792h-mGE\">https://youtu.be/FPC792h-mGE</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_The_Learning_Royal\">Video Solution by The Learning Royal</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by The Learning Royal\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/eSxzI8P9_h8\">https://youtu.be/eSxzI8P9_h8</a>\n</p><p>~The Learning Royal\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YnwkBZTv5Fw?t=34\">https://youtu.be/YnwkBZTv5Fw?t=34</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_North_America_Math_Contest_Go_Go_Go\">Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f428YRwoXO4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f428YRwoXO4</a>\n</p><p>~North America Math Contest Go Go Go\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_STEMbreezy\">Video Solution by STEMbreezy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by STEMbreezy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/L_vDc-i585o?list=PLFcinOE4FNL0TkI-_yKVEYyA_QCS9mBNS\">https://youtu.be/L_vDc-i585o?list=PLFcinOE4FNL0TkI-_yKVEYyA_QCS9mBNS</a>\n</p><p>~STEMbreezy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></spa